2. Patches (inherit upstream license)
-------------------------------------
Files under patches/ are derivative works of their upstreams and are governed
by those upstreams' licenses:

    patches/mesa/           MIT           (Mesa)
    patches/virglrenderer/  MIT           (virglrenderer)
    patches/minigbm/        BSD-3-Clause  (minigbm)
    patches/waydroid/       GPL-3.0       (waydroid)

When built and distributed (e.g. as an AUR package), the combined work must
respect each upstream component's license.

The pinned third-party sources and where each is used are listed in
THIRD_PARTY.md.

3. Native driver modes
----------------------
Original work under the MIT license above, same copyright line:

    nvidia-prolapse/      (shim, probe, hal, gralloc, libdrm, media, egl,
                           driver-source/native)
    dev/ additions        (driver-mode, source-native, native-deploy,
                           build-waydroid, deploy-guest, mc-vv, tests)
    hwcomposer/  angle/  tools/   (scripts and documentation)

Exceptions (inherit the upstream or stated license):

    waydroid/nvidia_native.py, waydroid/test_nvidia_native.py,
    waydroid/0001-lxc-nvidia-native-mounts.patch
                                      GPL-3.0-or-later (installed into Waydroid)
    waydroid/patches/                 Apache-2.0    (AOSP frameworks/native)
    hwcomposer/patches/               Apache-2.0    (android_hardware_waydroid)
    hwcomposer/aidl-stubs/, nvidia-prolapse/hal/include/android/,
    nvidia-prolapse/hal/include/host/, nvidia-prolapse/media/c2/,
    nvidia-prolapse/media/odm/, nvidia-prolapse/media/vndk/patches/
                                      Apache-2.0    (AOSP interfaces)
    nvidia-prolapse/gralloc/include/  Apache-2.0    (minigbm gbm_mesa wrapper ABI)
    nvidia-prolapse/gralloc/minigbm/  BSD-3-Clause  (minigbm)
    angle/patches/                    BSD-3-Clause  (ANGLE)
    nvidia-prolapse/driver-source/native/mesa/*.patch, gallium-nvrm/,
    nvidia-prolapse/driver-source/native/compiler/ (Mesa adaptation)
                                      MIT           (Mesa; see compiler/MESA-MIT.txt)
    nvidia-prolapse/driver-source/native/vendor/nvidia/
                                      MIT           (NVIDIA open headers, notice in file)
    nvidia-prolapse/driver-source/native/licenses/
                                      notices of ash (MIT/Apache-2.0), tinygrad (MIT)
                                      and NVIDIA's public headers (MIT)
    nvidia-prolapse/driver-source/native/src/vp9_tables.rs
                                      values from libvpx (BSD-3-Clause, notice in file)
    nvidia-prolapse/driver-source/native/src/video/av1/cdf_defaults.rs
                                      values from Mesa (MIT, AMD; notice in file)
    nvidia-prolapse/driver-source/native/src/video/av1/testdata/
                                      Big Buck Bunny (c) 2008 Blender Foundation,
                                      CC-BY 3.0, re-encoded (see README.md there)

No NVIDIA binary is part of this repository. The native modes load the host's
installed NVIDIA kernel module (and, in glibc-shim mode, the host's installed
NVIDIA userspace) at runtime, unmodified.
